    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        133.2415008544922,
        115.61629486083984,
        477.0094909667969,
        135.84349060058594
      ],
      "text": "rocedures for obtaining clinical",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.60459899902344,
        143.21633911132812,
        458.6592102050781,
        163.4435272216797
      ],
      "text": "samples for smear microscopy",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        187.1669921875,
        513.4490966796875,
        200.51849365234375
      ],
      "text": "This annex reviews basic procedures for the more common methods of obtaining clinical",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        203.16351318359375,
        513.46044921875,
        216.5150146484375
      ],
      "text": "samples from children for smear microscopy: expectoration, gastric aspiration and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        219.1600341796875,
        174.50938415527344,
        232.51153564453125
      ],
      "text": "sputum induction.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        246.15750122070312,
        176.83741760253906,
        262.74749755859375
      ],
      "text": "Expectoration",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        272.100830078125,
        155.04739379882812,
        288.8288269042969
      ],
      "text": "Background",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        295.84033203125,
        513.4144287109375,
        309.19183349609375
      ],
      "text": "All sputum specimens produced by children should be sent for smear microscopy and,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        311.83685302734375,
        513.4375610351562,
        325.1883544921875
      ],
      "text": "where available, mycobacterial culture. Children who can produce a sputum specimen",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        327.8333435058594,
        513.3684692382812,
        341.1848449707031
      ],
      "text": "may be infectious, so, as with adults, they should be asked to do this outside and not",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        343.829833984375,
        513.483642578125,
        357.18133544921875
      ],
      "text": "in enclosed spaces (such as toilets) unless there is a room especially equipped for this",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        359.8263244628906,
        513.4719848632812,
        373.1778259277344
      ],
      "text": "purpose. Two sputum specimens should be obtained: an on-the-spot specimen (at first",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        375.82281494140625,
        467.9894104003906,
        389.17431640625
      ],
      "text": "evaluation) and an early morning specimen (collected at home by the patient).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        403.44580078125,
        273.7773742675781,
        417.07330322265625
      ],
      "text": "Procedure  (adapted from reference 1)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        425.7213134765625,
        513.4144897460938,
        439.07281494140625
      ],
      "text": "1.\t Give the child confidence by explaining to him or her (and any family members) the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        441.7178039550781,
        245.8093719482422,
        455.0693054199219
      ],
      "text": "reason for sputum collection.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        463.7173156738281,
        513.3914794921875,
        477.0688171386719
      ],
      "text": "2.\t Instruct the child to rinse his or her mouth with water before producing the specimen.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        479.71380615234375,
        473.9349670410156,
        493.0653076171875
      ],
      "text": "This will help to remove food and any contaminating bacteria in the mouth.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        501.71331787109375,
        513.4491577148438,
        515.0648193359375
      ],
      "text": "3.\t Instruct the child to take two deep breaths, holding the breath for a few seconds",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        517.7097778320312,
        513.4834594726562,
        531.061279296875
      ],
      "text": "after each inhalation and then exhaling slowly. Ask him or her to breathe in a third",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        533.706298828125,
        513.4488525390625,
        547.0578002929688
      ],
      "text": "time and then forcefully blow the air out. Ask him or her to breathe in again and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        549.7028198242188,
        513.3685913085938,
        563.0543212890625
      ],
      "text": "then cough. This should produce sputum from deep in the lungs. Ask the child",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        565.6992797851562,
        513.3453979492188,
        579.05078125
      ],
      "text": "to hold the sputum container close to the lips and to spit into it gently after a",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        581.69580078125,
        191.5063934326172,
        595.0473022460938
      ],
      "text": "productive cough.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        603.6952514648438,
        513.4144897460938,
        617.0467529296875
      ],
      "text": "4.\t If the amount of sputum is insufficient, encourage the patient to cough again until",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        619.6917724609375,
        513.3798828125,
        633.0432739257812
      ],
      "text": "a satisfactory specimen is obtained. Remember that many patients cannot produce",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        635.6882934570312,
        513.4719848632812,
        649.039794921875
      ],
      "text": "sputum from deep in the respiratory track in only a few minutes. Give the child",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        651.684814453125,
        513.4144287109375,
        665.0363159179688
      ],
      "text": "sufficient time to produce an expectoration that he or she feels is produced by a",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        667.6813354492188,
        164.2513885498047,
        681.0328369140625
      ],
      "text": "deep cough.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        689.6807861328125,
        513.4603881835938,
        703.0322875976562
      ],
      "text": "5.\t If there is no expectoration, treat the container as used and dispose of it in the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        705.6773071289062,
        202.5808868408203,
        719.02880859375
      ],
      "text": "appropriate manner.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        553.0839233398438,
        805.8439331054688,
        586.4439086914062,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "119",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}